   "id": "sci.unit-conversion",
   "name": "Converting units",
   "explain": {
    "en": {
     "text": "To convert inside the SI, multiply or divide by the value of the prefix. Big unit to small unit: multiply (6.5 kg = 6.5 × 1000 g = 6500 g). Small unit to big unit: divide (200 m = 200 ÷ 1000 km = 0.2 km). For time: 1 hour = 60 min = 3600 s."
    },
